Package: UHHformats
Type: Package
Title: Templates for HTML, PDF, and Word Output Formats Designed for the UHH
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-03-17
Authors@R: person("Saskia", "Otto", email = "saskia.a.otto@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7780-1322"))
URL: https://uham-bio.github.io/UHHformats/, https://github.com/uham-bio/UHHformats
BugReports: https://github.com/uham-bio/UHHformats/issues
Description: R Markdown and Quarto templates for HTML, PDF, and MS Word documents, which are used
    within the Biology Department of the University of Hamburg (UHH) and its 'Data Science in Biology'
    program. These include templates for student assignments and project reports.
    The package aims to encourage reproducible research using simple Markdown syntax while
    embedding all of the R code to produce plots and analyses as well. Many templates are
    inspired by or based on other packages such as 'rmdformats' and 'ireports'.
